# The submodule checkouts. This is the single most important entry in this file: each
# repository under repos/ has its own prettier configuration, its own ignore list and
# its own formatting history, so formatting them from here would rewrite thousands of
# files against the wrong config — and `prettier --check .` in CI would fail on a
# populated workspace for changes nobody made in it.
#
# Format those files by running prettier in the repository that owns them:
#   ./scripts/ws.sh foreach 'pnpm prettier:fix'
repos/

node_modules/
pnpm-lock.yaml
